SELECT * FROM user_roles 
WHERE user_id = '<user-uuid>';

-- Verify business access
SELECT has_business_access('<user-uuid>', '<business-uuid>');
```

### Issue: Recommendations not generating
**Solution:** Check for sales data
```sql
